    "inherent": "critical",
    "residual": "high",
    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "Present inherent risk is critical because an untrusted ticket can influence shared-account identity operations and external delivery of a temporary pass, with S3 consequences. Residual remains high because the only declared preventive control is a raw-action analyst approval gate on MFA reset, and its high volume earns only one tier of credit; no declared structural control binds temporary-pass delivery to the account owner or gates that delivery. Forecast returns to critical if the approval gate is removed or autonomy increases, and the analyst approval control is the single decay point that changes the rating most. Manual validation applied against the checklist because scripts could not be run."
  },
